hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"72","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai — unhon ne kaha, aur Aap ke samne taaun ka zikr hua — phir Aap ne farmaya: '[Taaun] gandagi [azab] hai jo nazil hui, ya jis se ummaton mein se ek ummat ko azab diya gaya, aur us mein se baqiyat reh gayin. Phir jab tum us ke bare mein kisi zameen mein suno to us mein dakhil na ho. Aur jab wo kisi zameen mein waqe ho jabke tum us mein ho to us se bhago mat.' Muhammad bin Munkadir ne kaha: To main ne ye hadees Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ko bayan ki, phir unhon ne kaha: Isi tarah mujhe Amir bin Sa'd ne bayan ki."
"73","[AI-translation] Amir bin Sa'd bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Usamah bin Zaid ko Sa'd bin Malik ke paas kehte hue dekha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak taaun gandagi [azab] hai jo tum se pehle logon par, ya Bani Israel par nazil hui. Phir jab wo kisi zameen mein payi jaye to us mein dakhil na ho. Aur jab wo kisi zameen mein payi jaye jabke tum us mein ho to us se niklo mat.'"
"74","[AI-translation] Habib bin Abi Sabit se, Ibrahim bin Sa'd se riwayat hai: Ke unhon ne isi tarah kaha, phir unhon ne isi ki manind bayan kiya."
"75","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Hafs se riwayat hai: Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ne mujhe Amir bin Sa'd se isi ki manind bayan kiya. Wo sab Usamah [bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhuma)] se zikr karte hain."
"76","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai: Ke Amir bin Sa'd ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz ko — jabke wo Madinah ke governor the — bayan kiya ke Sa'd bin Malik ne unhen khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Madinah ke dono kale pathreeli ilaqon ke darmiyan [ugne wali] ajwah khajoor ke saat dane khaye, aur un se ibtida kare, use us din raat tak zeher nuqsan na dega.' [Rawi ne] kaha: To Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne un se kaha: Dekho tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kya bayan karte ho, aye Amir. To Amir ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Sa'd par jhoot nahin kaha, aur na Sa'd ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par jhoot kaha. To Umar ne kaha: Aur main gawahi deta hun ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jhoot nahin kaha."
